  "answer_text": "The closing price for the **Grayscale Bitcoin Trust ETF (GBTC)** is **$46.80**. \n\nBecause the stock market is currently closed, this reflects the final price at the close of regular trading on **Friday, June 5, 2026**.\n\n### **Market Summary & Key Statistics (as of June 5, 2026)**\n* **Last Closing Price:** $46.80 (down **-5.15%** or **-$2.54** during Friday's regular session)\n* **After-Hours Price:** ~$47.11 (up **+0.66%** in extended-hours trading)\n* **Day's Range:** $45.88 \u2013 $48.36\n* **52-Week Range:** $45.88 \u2013 $99.12\n* **Volume:** 1.28M shares\n* **Market Capitalization:** ~$8.74 Billion\n\n### **Market Context**\nGBTC and other spot Bitcoin ETFs faced notable downward pressure, driven by a broader pullback in the cryptocurrency market. During the week ending June 5, 2026, U.S. spot Bitcoin ETFs experienced significant net outflows, with investors pulling more than $144 million from GBTC alone. This pressure pushed the ETF to hit a new 52-week low of $45.88 on Friday before recovering slightly to close at $46.80.\n\n*Note: Regular stock market trading will resume on Monday morning, June 8, 2026.*",
